>>
endobj
267 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (CREMA-D is a data set of 7,442 original clips from 91 actors. These clips were from 48 male and 43 female actors between the ages of 20 and 74 coming from a variety of races and ethnicities \(African America, Asian, Caucasian, Hispanic, and Unspecified\). Actors spoke from a selection of 12 sentences. The sentences were presented using one of six different emotions \(Anger, Disgust, Fear, Happy, Neutral, and Sad\) and four different emotion levels \(Low, Medium, High, and Unspecified\).)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
