/S /Figure
/P 140 0 R
/Pg 24 0 R
/A [555 0 R 0]
/K [3]
>>
endobj
302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 141 0 R
/Pg 25 0 R
/A [556 0 R 0]
/K [0]
>>
endobj
303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 141 0 R
/E (The proposed model demonstrated moderate performance in the task of Speech Emotion Recognition \(SER\). Its best overall result was an Accuracy of 52.73% on the RAVDESS dataset, but it suffered from extreme generalization failure, with accuracy plummeting to 17.51% when it was cross validated on the CREMA-D dataset.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
304 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 141 0 R
/E ( In sharp contrast, the developed model \(GL-DSED\), showcased a vastly superior performance on the same core task. When tested on the EmoDB dataset, the developed model achieved an Unweighted Accuracy \(UA\) of 87.61%. This represents an improvement of over 34 percentage points compared to the developed model's best result.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
